# {{.Name}}

A Gleipnir plugin generated by `gleipnir-plugin new`.

## Quickstart

```bash
# Build the plugin binary
make build

# Run tests
make test

# Generate manifest.yaml from code declarations
make gen-manifest

# Validate manifest against binary
make validate

# Package for distribution (requires a signing key)
make package
```

## Development

1. Edit `service.go` to implement your plugin logic.
2. Edit `manifest.go` to declare tools / event kinds / channels.
3. Run `make gen-manifest` to regenerate `manifest.yaml`.
4. Run `make validate` to verify the manifest matches the binary.

See `docs/developer/plugin-system-spec.md` for the full plugin specification.
